# Phase B build artefacts.
# next-env.d.ts and tsconfig.tsbuildinfo are regenerated by `next build` and `tsc`; committing them
# produces a diff on every build that reviews nothing. `generated/` is where a future
# `prisma generate` writes the client — generated code is not source and must not be reviewed as if
# it were.
next-env.d.ts
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
generated/
